  "transcription_rules": [
    "Prices are copied exactly from the source; none are calculated or inferred.",
    "A source line carrying two items and two prices (e.g. 'Dry Papad/Fry Papad 120/180') is split into two items.",
    "A source line offering one item in several sizes becomes one item plus variants, priced per size.",
    "Menu-card spellings are kept; only obvious typographic slips are normalised and listed in `spelling_normalised`.",
    "Where the two printed cards disagree on a shared drink, the food card wins because it is the newer photographed card. Every such case is listed in `conflicts` for the client to confirm."
